<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-NATAL BEAT INDIA BY 52 RUNS IN ONE-DAY MATCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NATAL BEAT INDIA BY 52 RUNS IN ONE-DAY MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN, South Africa 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Natal beat India by</p>
<p>52 runs in their one-day cricket match at Kingsmead on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Natal 288-5 in 55 overs. India 236-7 in 55 overs.</p>
</text>
